      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "cweagans/composer-patches 1.7.3, in 3rdparty/ of Nextcloud 31"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "vendor/ ships 1 package that the server ships itself in a major of Nextcloud 31. Both copies define the same classes, and the autoloader that is asked first decides which version runs.",
